{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48368","headline":"蜀选人嘲韩昭 · 无名氏","name":"蜀选人嘲韩昭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"嘉眉邛蜀，侍郎骨肉。\n导江青城，侍郎情亲。\n果阆二州，侍郎自留。\n巴蓬集壁，侍郎不识。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48368.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48368","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}